{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109345","id":2722584691,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6iR1hz","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109345","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109345.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109345.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109345","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109345/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109345/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109345/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b4203f7f643640dd0a0212f454e8894aac018021","number":109345,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Prevent shallow scripts from leaking into the `ResourceCache`","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is a new attempt at https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/96499 that also includes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102063\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/95909\r\nFixes (maybe) https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/95789 (the described crash, does not occur with this PR when run from editor. I did not test exporting as mentioned in the issue though. Also the MRP trows a lot of errors when opening, nut sure if that is related).\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/93433\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110332\r\n\r\nBugsquad edit:\r\nFixes [#110394](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110394)\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/87397 according to @Maran23\r\n\r\nDoes not reintroduce https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99006 or https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101615\r\n\r\nThe main difference from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/96499 is that in this PR `set_path_cache` does not interact with `GDScriptCache`. This prevents shallow loaded scripts from having any side effects on other fully loaded scripts (which would lead to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99006 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101615). It also does not break shallow loaded script behavior since `set_path_cache` is only used when there is no shallow script for that path present.\r\n\r\nRegardless of the specifics in here, I believe that the approach taken in this PR and #96499 is the correct one. Shallow scripts are an implementation detail of GDScript compilation. They must not end up in the `ResourceCache`. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97302 tries to fix the scripts after they leaked into the cache. Those partially loaded scripts fixing themselves when creating instances solves some issues but there is more that one could do with scripts than creating instances. Also users simply expect resource loading to do the actual loading work.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z","due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-08-05T22:47:27Z","updated_at":"20